        },
        {
          "text": " Reeba, abanyiginya ba Israeli ab'omuriiwe, buri omwe aine omutima ogurikururuuhira okusheesha eshagama, nk'oku obushoboorozi bwe buri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
