              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omuriiwe abantu nibarya enguzi kusheesha eshagama; nootwara ekiteebwamu n'enshaagi; otunga amagoba ahari bataahi baawe ahabw'okuhata; haza nyowe onyebwa; nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugira.",
