        },
        {
          "text": " Baanabi baayo basiigiriize ebisiika ahabw'abo bategyeki n'obudongo obutanogire, nibareeba eby'okworekwa ebitari by'amazima, nibabaragurira ebishuba, nibagira bati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, haza ataine ki agambire. ",
